<title>BELGIUM: PAUL DE KEERSMAEKER NEW KREDIETBANK CHAIRMAN.</title>
<headline>PAUL DE KEERSMAEKER NEW KREDIETBANK CHAIRMAN.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paul De Keersmaeker will replace Marc Santens as chairman of the board of Belgian Kredietbank at the end of June, Kredietbank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Santens was named chairman in 1994.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
